# Patrones de componentes — Logr

## Componente UI base (components/ui/)

Patrón: `forwardRef` + variantes como `Record` + `cn()`.

Referencia: `@/components/ui/button.tsx`

```tsx
"use client";
import { forwardRef, type ButtonHTMLAttributes } from "react";
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils/cn";

type Variant = "default" | "ghost" | "outline" | "accent" | "destructive";
const variantStyles: Record<Variant, string> = { ... };

const Button = forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>(
  ({ className, variant = "default", size = "md", ...props }, ref) => (
    <button ref={ref} className={cn(base, variantStyles[variant], className)} {...props} />
  )
);
```

## Componente de módulo (components/[modulo]/)

Patrón: `"use client"` + `useLocale()` + hook de datos + `useXp()` para XP.

Referencia: `@/components/habits/HabitCard.tsx`

- Importar `useLocale` de `@/contexts/locale-context`
- Mover labels/mapas que dependan de `t` DENTRO del cuerpo del componente
- Usar `t.modulo.key` para todo texto visible
- Llamar `awardXp(amount, source, id, t.modulo.xpMessage)` al completar acciones

## Página de dashboard

Referencia: `@/app/(dashboard)/habits/page.tsx`

```tsx
"use client";
import { PageHeader } from "@/components/shared/PageHeader";
import { useLocale } from "@/contexts/locale-context";

export default function ModuloPage() {
  const { t } = useLocale();
  return (
    <div className="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8">
      <PageHeader title={t.modulo.pageTitle} description={t.modulo.pageDesc} />
    </div>
  );
}
```

- Container: `mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8`
- Siempre usar `PageHeader` con `title` y `description`
- Botón de acción se pasa como prop `action` de `PageHeader`

## Formularios

Referencia: `@/components/tasks/TaskForm.tsx`

- Inputs: `w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/40`
- Labels: `text-sm font-medium text-foreground`
- Botón submit: `<Button variant="accent">` con estado loading
- Checkboxes: `h-4 w-4 rounded border-border text-accent focus:ring-accent/40`
- Select: mismas clases que input

## Server components

Referencia: `@/app/(dashboard)/layout.tsx`

- Usar `createClient()` de `@/lib/supabase/server`
- Para i18n: `const t = await getT()` de `@/lib/i18n/server`
- Redirect: `redirect("/login")` de `next/navigation`
